{"videoId":"087qjp8OVsE","source":"auto","lang":"en","sentences":[{"start":0.32,"end":1.88,"text":"In 2017,"},{"start":1.88,"end":3.4,"text":"when I looked like a 12-year-old"},{"start":3.4,"end":4.44,"text":"scarecrow,"},{"start":4.44,"end":6.24,"text":"I made a video on YouTube"},{"start":6.24,"end":8.48,"text":"about the most important sounds"},{"start":8.48,"end":9.6,"text":"in English."},{"start":9.6,"end":12.16,"text":"In British English, in all English."},{"start":12.16,"end":14.32,"text":"The schwa sound. It's the schwa sound."},{"start":14.32,"end":15.2,"text":"Uh."},{"start":15.2,"end":16.64,"text":"10 years later,"},{"start":16.64,"end":18.64,"text":"this video has had"},{"start":18.64,"end":21.24,"text":"over a million views across social media."},{"start":21.24,"end":24.16,"text":"And also, it's being used in schools"},{"start":24.16,"end":26.52,"text":"around the world."},{"start":26.52,"end":31.04,"text":"I still can't believe that, to be honest. But, I hate it because there's so much"},{"start":31.04,"end":36.16,"text":"missing, so much more I could teach you. After 10 years of working as a pronunciation"},{"start":36.16,"end":37.08,"text":"coach,"},{"start":37.08,"end":39.2,"text":"I feel like it's time"},{"start":39.2,"end":42.28,"text":"to give you everything I can in 10 minutes"},{"start":42.28,"end":45.12,"text":"about the schwa sound. It's the schwa sound."},{"start":45.12,"end":46.4,"text":"Should we do it?"},{"start":46.4,"end":48.24,"text":"So,"},{"start":48.24,"end":49.04,"text":"Mm."},{"start":49.04,"end":52.24,"text":"Okay, where do I begin?"},{"start":52.24,"end":53.68,"text":"How does the schwa sound?"},{"start":53.68,"end":55.4,"text":"It sounds like this."},{"start":55.4,"end":56.56,"text":"Uh."},{"start":56.56,"end":57.64,"text":"Uh."},{"start":57.64,"end":58.8,"text":"Uh."},{"start":58.8,"end":59.64,"text":"Uh."},{"start":59.64,"end":61.4,"text":"About."},{"start":61.4,"end":63.52,"text":"Uh. About."},{"start":63.52,"end":65.0,"text":"About."},{"start":65.0,"end":69.4,"text":"Your tongue stays in the middle of your mouth. Imagine a car."},{"start":69.4,"end":71.12,"text":"If you drive a manual car,"},{"start":71.12,"end":74.8,"text":"when your car is in neutral gear, you can't move."},{"start":74.8,"end":78.24,"text":"The tongue just stays lazy in the middle of the mouth."},{"start":78.24,"end":82.4,"text":"You don't need to open your jaw much. You don't really need to do anything. Just"},{"start":82.4,"end":86.28,"text":"push sound out with a neutral tongue in the middle of your mouth."},{"start":86.28,"end":87.24,"text":"Uh."},{"start":87.24,"end":88.84,"text":"Uh. Uh."},{"start":88.84,"end":94.24,"text":"Neutral gear. Remember that. It's the most common sound in English, in British English especially."},{"start":94.24,"end":95.68,"text":"It's hiding everywhere."},{"start":95.68,"end":97.36,"text":"It's hiding in words."},{"start":97.36,"end":101.16,"text":"It's also used to relax the boring words"},{"start":101.16,"end":103.08,"text":"so that we can have a better rhythm,"},{"start":103.08,"end":106.96,"text":"sentence stress. If we have words like to,"},{"start":106.96,"end":108.36,"text":"say t."},{"start":108.36,"end":110.48,"text":"I want to buy this."},{"start":110.48,"end":111.88,"text":"For,"},{"start":111.88,"end":113.04,"text":"f."},{"start":113.04,"end":115.04,"text":"What's for dinner?"},{"start":115.04,"end":116.52,"text":"Can,"},{"start":116.52,"end":117.68,"text":"c."},{"start":117.68,"end":119.48,"text":"I can do it."},{"start":119.48,"end":120.92,"text":"of"},{"start":120.92,"end":122.08,"text":"v"},{"start":122.08,"end":123.64,"text":"The capital of England"},{"start":123.64,"end":125.96,"text":"is London."},{"start":125.96,"end":127.48,"text":"as"},{"start":127.48,"end":129.12,"text":"z"},{"start":129.12,"end":129.84,"text":"It's"},{"start":129.84,"end":132.12,"text":"as good as new."},{"start":132.12,"end":134.64,"text":"It's as good as new."},{"start":134.64,"end":137.56,"text":"Don't worry if that's too advanced for you right now."},{"start":137.56,"end":140.32,"text":"We can talk about that in sentence stress."},{"start":140.32,"end":144.88,"text":"Point number two, I would say, is that it's really, really lazy."},{"start":144.88,"end":149.16,"text":"It's so lazy that sometimes you can't even hear it. It's like it's not there, but"},{"start":149.16,"end":151.92,"text":"it is. For example, if we take the word"},{"start":151.92,"end":153.44,"text":"computer."},{"start":153.44,"end":154.16,"text":"com-"},{"start":154.16,"end":155.4,"text":"puter"},{"start":155.4,"end":157.32,"text":"You hear how lazy"},{"start":157.32,"end":159.04,"text":"and how relaxed I sound"},{"start":159.04,"end":160.8,"text":"on that uh sound."},{"start":160.8,"end":162.12,"text":"computer"},{"start":162.12,"end":167.4,"text":"And the third point I would say, something that makes it very special to British pronunciation,"},{"start":167.4,"end":169.68,"text":"is that it's one of the r-replacing"},{"start":169.68,"end":170.52,"text":"sounds."},{"start":170.52,"end":173.2,"text":"One of the sounds that replaces the consonant"},{"start":173.2,"end":174.64,"text":"r."},{"start":174.64,"end":176.64,"text":"You notice when I said"},{"start":176.64,"end":177.84,"text":"computer,"},{"start":177.84,"end":179.64,"text":"I didn't say computer."},{"start":179.64,"end":182.52,"text":"I didn't pronounce the r at the end, and that's because"},{"start":182.52,"end":185.52,"text":"we don't pronounce r's at the end of words."},{"start":185.52,"end":189.64,"text":"So, we're going to use the schwa to replace that r in this word, just like"},{"start":189.64,"end":191.12,"text":"we do in teacher,"},{"start":191.12,"end":192.24,"text":"doctor."},{"start":192.24,"end":194.88,"text":"And listen to how lazy I am. uh"},{"start":194.88,"end":195.84,"text":"uh"},{"start":195.84,"end":196.6,"text":"gentle"},{"start":196.6,"end":197.52,"text":"and relaxed."},{"start":197.52,"end":200.04,"text":"And finally, the schwa only happens"},{"start":200.04,"end":201.4,"text":"in unstressed"},{"start":201.4,"end":202.36,"text":"syllables."},{"start":202.36,"end":203.56,"text":"So, if you see"},{"start":203.56,"end":207.72,"text":"a stress marker, there will never be a schwa there. So, before we start going into"},{"start":207.72,"end":209.84,"text":"some words, let's begin"},{"start":209.84,"end":212.72,"text":"by remembering how we pronounce the schwa."},{"start":212.72,"end":216.44,"text":"Relax your jaw, relax your face, relax your body,"},{"start":216.44,"end":218.6,"text":"relax your lips."},{"start":218.6,"end":220.04,"text":"uh"},{"start":220.04,"end":221.4,"text":"uh"},{"start":221.4,"end":222.24,"text":"uh"},{"start":222.24,"end":225.56,"text":"Now, make it as lazy as possible. Take down your percentage"},{"start":225.56,"end":229.08,"text":"of effort to like 10% less."},{"start":229.08,"end":230.52,"text":"uh"},{"start":230.52,"end":231.96,"text":"about"},{"start":231.96,"end":233.44,"text":"uh"},{"start":233.44,"end":235.36,"text":"about"},{"start":235.36,"end":237.32,"text":"super lazy"},{"start":237.32,"end":239.04,"text":"around"},{"start":239.04,"end":240.0,"text":"uh"},{"start":240.0,"end":242.16,"text":"around"},{"start":242.16,"end":243.24,"text":"She walked"},{"start":243.24,"end":243.96,"text":"around"},{"start":243.96,"end":247.2,"text":"the corner slowly."},{"start":247.2,"end":251.32,"text":"She walked around the corner slowly."},{"start":251.32,"end":253.28,"text":"ago"},{"start":253.28,"end":254.16,"text":"uh"},{"start":254.16,"end":255.6,"text":"ago"},{"start":255.6,"end":256.64,"text":"I heard"},{"start":256.64,"end":257.36,"text":"about"},{"start":257.36,"end":258.32,"text":"that"},{"start":258.32,"end":261.4,"text":"years ago."},{"start":261.4,"end":264.72,"text":"I heard about that years ago."},{"start":264.72,"end":266.72,"text":"again"},{"start":266.72,"end":267.92,"text":"uh"},{"start":267.92,"end":270.24,"text":"again"},{"start":270.24,"end":274.68,"text":"Can you say that again, please?"},{"start":274.68,"end":277.48,"text":"Can you say that again, please?"},{"start":277.48,"end":279.36,"text":"away"},{"start":279.36,"end":280.36,"text":"uh"},{"start":280.36,"end":282.92,"text":"away"},{"start":282.92,"end":284.28,"text":"We're going away"},{"start":284.28,"end":287.68,"text":"next week."},{"start":287.68,"end":290.44,"text":"We're going away next week."},{"start":290.44,"end":291.6,"text":"uh"},{"start":291.6,"end":294.32,"text":"object"},{"start":294.32,"end":295.92,"text":"object"},{"start":295.92,"end":299.16,"text":"I object."},{"start":299.16,"end":300.76,"text":"I object."},{"start":300.76,"end":304.64,"text":"Notice how it's only happening in unstressed syllables, and notice"},{"start":304.64,"end":306.2,"text":"how it's often replacing"},{"start":306.2,"end":307.28,"text":"a"},{"start":307.28,"end":312.44,"text":"and o. So, don't always look at the spelling and think, \"I know how it's pronounced."},{"start":312.44,"end":314.6,"text":"It's an a, so it should be a.\""},{"start":314.6,"end":315.4,"text":"Unfortunately,"},{"start":315.4,"end":316.64,"text":"English"},{"start":316.64,"end":320.32,"text":"it's not as simple as that, and it's really frustrating,"},{"start":320.32,"end":323.32,"text":"and it's one of the hardest parts of learning pronunciation,"},{"start":323.32,"end":324.32,"text":"for sure."},{"start":324.32,"end":326.64,"text":"Not everything is as it seems."},{"start":326.64,"end":328.84,"text":"Okay, so in the middle of words."},{"start":328.84,"end":333.08,"text":"Firstly, it's really common when we have words beginning with c o m and c o"},{"start":333.08,"end":335.32,"text":"n, but only when they're an unstressed"},{"start":335.32,"end":340.28,"text":"syllable. In company, it's a stressed syllable, so there won't be a schwa."},{"start":340.28,"end":341.88,"text":"But, in the word"},{"start":341.88,"end":343.52,"text":"combine"},{"start":343.52,"end":345.44,"text":"we have to do a schwa"},{"start":345.44,"end":348.0,"text":"because c o m and c n"},{"start":348.0,"end":349.64,"text":"when they're unstressed"},{"start":349.64,"end":356.88,"text":"they're going to be com or con most of the time. He combined the information."},{"start":356.88,"end":359.48,"text":"in-for-ma-shun"},{"start":359.48,"end":360.64,"text":"He combined"},{"start":360.64,"end":362.6,"text":"the information."},{"start":362.6,"end":364.4,"text":"And c o n"},{"start":364.4,"end":366.04,"text":"continue"},{"start":366.04,"end":366.92,"text":"con"},{"start":366.92,"end":369.84,"text":"continue"},{"start":369.84,"end":372.6,"text":"Can you continue, please?"},{"start":372.6,"end":373.96,"text":"Can you"},{"start":373.96,"end":375.04,"text":"continue,"},{"start":375.04,"end":377.0,"text":"please?"},{"start":377.0,"end":379.12,"text":"Can you continue, please?"},{"start":379.12,"end":383.0,"text":"yes-ter-day"},{"start":383.0,"end":385.44,"text":"yesterday"},{"start":385.44,"end":389.0,"text":"I saw her yesterday."},{"start":389.0,"end":391.24,"text":"I saw her yesterday."},{"start":391.24,"end":393.24,"text":"tomorrow"},{"start":393.24,"end":394.32,"text":"tuh"},{"start":394.32,"end":396.64,"text":"tomorrow"},{"start":396.64,"end":400.24,"text":"Let's catch up tomorrow."},{"start":400.24,"end":402.64,"text":"Let's catch up tomorrow."},{"start":402.64,"end":405.36,"text":"photograph"},{"start":405.36,"end":407.84,"text":"pho-to-graph"},{"start":407.84,"end":410.08,"text":"He took a photograph"},{"start":410.08,"end":411.92,"text":"of the sunset."},{"start":411.92,"end":412.76,"text":"uv"},{"start":412.76,"end":413.6,"text":"thuh"},{"start":413.6,"end":414.52,"text":"uh-vuh"},{"start":414.52,"end":415.32,"text":"vuh"},{"start":415.32,"end":416.48,"text":"uv-thuh"},{"start":416.48,"end":418.36,"text":"He took a photograph"},{"start":418.36,"end":419.96,"text":"of the sunset."},{"start":419.96,"end":423.28,"text":"national"},{"start":423.28,"end":424.84,"text":"national"},{"start":424.84,"end":428.16,"text":"It's a national holiday here."},{"start":428.16,"end":430.6,"text":"It's a national holiday here."},{"start":430.6,"end":432.68,"text":"information"},{"start":432.68,"end":436.12,"text":"Get used to those shun endings as well."},{"start":436.12,"end":437.88,"text":"Information"},{"start":437.88,"end":440.0,"text":"happens twice."},{"start":440.0,"end":442.52,"text":"Thanks for the information."},{"start":442.52,"end":445.2,"text":"in-for-ma-shun"},{"start":445.2,"end":447.84,"text":"Thanks for the information."},{"start":447.84,"end":451.08,"text":"And at the end of the words, don't forget it's really common for this schwa sound"},{"start":451.08,"end":453.68,"text":"to replace the r. So, for example,"},{"start":453.68,"end":456.0,"text":"he is a doctor."},{"start":456.0,"end":458.44,"text":"She is a teacher."},{"start":458.44,"end":461.0,"text":"And in a bit more relaxed, faster speech"},{"start":461.0,"end":462.6,"text":"he is a doctor."},{"start":462.6,"end":463.76,"text":"She is a teacher."},{"start":463.76,"end":466.32,"text":"You see, it's even more relaxed now. Adventure,"},{"start":466.32,"end":469.48,"text":"it happens at the beginning and at the end."},{"start":469.48,"end":472.12,"text":"We're going on an"},{"start":472.12,"end":474.36,"text":"ad ven ture."},{"start":474.36,"end":477.12,"text":"We're going on an adventure."},{"start":477.12,"end":481.0,"text":"We're going on an adventure."},{"start":481.0,"end":483.28,"text":"We're going on an adventure."},{"start":483.28,"end":486.12,"text":"b na na"},{"start":486.12,"end":488.52,"text":"banana"},{"start":488.52,"end":491.36,"text":"Peel the banana."},{"start":491.36,"end":492.88,"text":"Peel the banana."},{"start":492.88,"end":495.16,"text":"so fa"},{"start":495.16,"end":496.6,"text":"sofa"},{"start":496.6,"end":498.0,"text":"The cat is sleeping"},{"start":498.0,"end":499.04,"text":"on the sofa."},{"start":499.04,"end":501.72,"text":"The cat is sleeping on the sofa."},{"start":501.72,"end":503.76,"text":"ca me ra"},{"start":503.76,"end":506.0,"text":"ca me ra"},{"start":506.0,"end":509.96,"text":"I'm filming this on a camera."},{"start":509.96,"end":512.56,"text":"I'm filming this on a camera."},{"start":512.56,"end":514.76,"text":"da ta"},{"start":514.76,"end":517.4,"text":"da ta"},{"start":517.4,"end":520.12,"text":"We need to check the data first."},{"start":520.12,"end":521.44,"text":"t check"},{"start":521.44,"end":522.76,"text":"to check"},{"start":522.76,"end":526.68,"text":"We need to check the data first."},{"start":526.68,"end":529.24,"text":"ex tra"},{"start":529.24,"end":530.6,"text":"extra"},{"start":530.6,"end":533.84,"text":"Can I get some extra cheese, please?"},{"start":533.84,"end":535.04,"text":"c"},{"start":535.04,"end":536.84,"text":"Can I get"},{"start":536.84,"end":538.44,"text":"some extra cheese,"},{"start":538.44,"end":539.92,"text":"please?"},{"start":539.92,"end":542.48,"text":"Can I get some extra cheese, please?"},{"start":542.48,"end":546.52,"text":"And now just a couple of words where it happens multiple times just because it's kind"},{"start":546.52,"end":549.72,"text":"of useful. un der stand"},{"start":549.72,"end":551.84,"text":"a bly"},{"start":551.84,"end":553.72,"text":"understandably"},{"start":553.72,"end":555.92,"text":"She was understandably"},{"start":555.92,"end":557.32,"text":"upset"},{"start":557.32,"end":558.16,"text":"about"},{"start":558.16,"end":559.84,"text":"it."},{"start":559.84,"end":561.12,"text":"She was understandably"},{"start":561.12,"end":564.36,"text":"upset about it."},{"start":564.36,"end":565.2,"text":"pho"},{"start":565.2,"end":569.04,"text":"to gra pher pher"},{"start":569.04,"end":572.04,"text":"pho to gra pher"},{"start":572.04,"end":573.88,"text":"photographer"},{"start":573.88,"end":575.36,"text":"He works"},{"start":575.36,"end":576.84,"text":"as a"},{"start":576.84,"end":578.4,"text":"photographer"},{"start":578.4,"end":580.24,"text":"in London."},{"start":580.24,"end":581.48,"text":"Lun-"},{"start":581.48,"end":583.2,"text":"dun uh un."},{"start":583.2,"end":586.12,"text":"So many people get that one wrong."},{"start":586.12,"end":587.16,"text":"He works"},{"start":587.16,"end":588.32,"text":"as a photographer"},{"start":588.32,"end":590.48,"text":"in London."},{"start":590.48,"end":591.84,"text":"He works as a photographer"},{"start":591.84,"end":592.96,"text":"in London."},{"start":592.96,"end":596.0,"text":"Tem- pra- cha."},{"start":596.0,"end":598.16,"text":"Temperature."},{"start":598.16,"end":599.92,"text":"The temperature"},{"start":599.92,"end":601.96,"text":"has been really high"},{"start":601.96,"end":605.08,"text":"this summer."},{"start":605.08,"end":606.2,"text":"The temperature"},{"start":606.2,"end":609.12,"text":"has been really high this summer."},{"start":609.12,"end":610.56,"text":"Po- pyu-"},{"start":610.56,"end":612.08,"text":"la."},{"start":612.08,"end":614.12,"text":"Popular."},{"start":614.12,"end":616.68,"text":"This cafe has been really popular"},{"start":616.68,"end":618.52,"text":"this year."},{"start":618.52,"end":620.76,"text":"This cafe has been really popular"},{"start":620.76,"end":622.76,"text":"this year."},{"start":622.76,"end":626.0,"text":"English is so confusing and it's hard to look for rules."},{"start":626.0,"end":630.2,"text":"My best advice is just to find words you use a lot in your day-to-day life."},{"start":630.2,"end":631.72,"text":"Use AI"},{"start":631.72,"end":632.56,"text":"to transcribe"},{"start":632.56,"end":636.2,"text":"things into phonetics and write your thoughts down"},{"start":636.2,"end":640.88,"text":"into AI and notice how many times the schwa sound appears. I promise you it will"},{"start":640.88,"end":645.96,"text":"be a lot. On average, it's one in every three vowel sounds that we pronounce."},{"start":645.96,"end":647.72,"text":"It's so common."},{"start":647.72,"end":652.8,"text":"And remember it's also used in those weak forms, to ta, for fa."},{"start":652.8,"end":655.56,"text":"So, it needs to become your best friend"},{"start":655.56,"end":659.28,"text":"for English in general, not just British pronunciation."},{"start":659.28,"end":660.68,"text":"The problem is"},{"start":660.68,"end":664.0,"text":"it's hard to know if you're doing it right or wrong or if you missed a"},{"start":664.0,"end":664.72,"text":"schwa,"},{"start":664.72,"end":666.84,"text":"if you made a mistake."},{"start":666.84,"end":670.44,"text":"That's where I could come in if you need someone to help you, to correct you,"},{"start":670.44,"end":672.88,"text":"to hold your hand on your British pronunciation"},{"start":672.88,"end":675.44,"text":"or accent reduction journey."},{"start":675.44,"end":678.56,"text":"I have a course. I have private coaching."},{"start":678.56,"end":682.32,"text":"Uh I have loads of different things I can do to help you. So, feel free"},{"start":682.32,"end":686.32,"text":"to check out the links below if you want to book a discovery call and discuss"},{"start":686.32,"end":687.48,"text":"your goals."},{"start":687.48,"end":690.6,"text":"I'd be more than happy to meet you and talk to you and work out how"},{"start":690.6,"end":692.76,"text":"I can help you. I also do communication"},{"start":692.76,"end":694.52,"text":"coaching for executives,"},{"start":694.52,"end":697.72,"text":"people in high-stakes business meetings, performers,"},{"start":697.72,"end":702.36,"text":"whatever you might be. So, there's something for everyone. Anyone who needs to use their voice,"},{"start":702.36,"end":704.16,"text":"I'm your man."},{"start":704.16,"end":707.96,"text":"Thank you very much for watching. Don't forget to hit the thumbs up, subscribe"},{"start":707.96,"end":712.6,"text":"if you would be so kind, and I will see you in the next video."},{"start":712.6,"end":716.04,"text":"Thank you very much. Have a lovely day. Take care. Cheers, guys. Bye."}]}